Dettato Studio
==============

This application is an original GUI written for the dettato library.
It does NOT contain a copy of the dettato source code in this repository;
dettato is used as an external dependency (installed via pip from
https://github.com/kobimusic/dettato).

Third-party components
----------------------
- dettato (kobimusic/dettato) — Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/kobimusic/dettato
  Model weights are downloaded at runtime from the Hugging Face Hub
  (kobimusic/dettato, dettato-evidence, dettato-grouper, dettato-drums)
  and are NOT included in this repository. Note: dettato's model cards
  list training datasets, some of which carry non-commercial terms —
  see the dettato repository / model cards for details.
- PySide6 / Qt — LGPLv3 (dynamically linked; in PyInstaller builds it
  ships as separate library files in _internal\)
- PyTorch — BSD-style license (see PyTorch repository)
- NumPy, soundfile, mido, huggingface_hub — see each project's license

Binary distributions (exe builds) bundle the dependencies above inside
_internal\, so when redistributing a built exe folder, keep this NOTICE
and the LICENSE file with it.
